  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing a secure and flexible platform from which Phase 1 of the Libyan Security, Justice and Defence Programme can be delivered.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the delivery of the security, justice and defence programme in Libya by providing the relevant life support and platform for the staff delivering the projects. This support will contribute to the overall programme which in turn will directly benefit Libyan Government institutions and citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
